You can estimate hidden markov models using the state 
space functions in S+FinMetrics 2.0. The state 
space functions allow Markov regime switching in the state space system 
matrices. Estimation, filtering and smoothing follows Kim's algorithm (see Kim 
and Nelson State Space Models with Regime Switching, MIT Press). 

ez

